    {
      "id": "1558016741609701469",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-09T07:22:17.751+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I might have missed something, but I don’t think there’s been more than a basic check of functionality on a couple of run 1 dies. A number of run 2 projects use it though so there should be significantly more confidence before the run 3 deadline.\n\nUntil run 2 testing starts, I think this is still accurate:\nhttps://discord.com/channels/1361349522684510449/1532458465379750028/1532694419164233878",
      "author": {
        "id": "691780627338625077",
